    "body": "This PR fixes a bug where AutoTP checkpoint loading would raise an \\AttributeError: 'NoneType' object has no attribute 'data'\\ if a buffer in the module is \\None\\ (such as \\\running_mean\\ in \\\nn.InstanceNorm1d\\). We simply skip \\None\\ buffers during loading. Fixes #8514.",
